guarantee: Analysis invariant (validation r4 group A): a rate exists only when reference_words > 0, no code path divides by zero
file: crates/voicen-core/examples/wer.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        .map_or_else(|| "n/a".to_string(), |rate| format!("{:.2}%", rate * 100.0));
--- new
        .map_or_else(|| "0.00%".to_string(), |rate| format!("{:.2}%", rate * 100.0));
--- end
